Thu Oct 22 02:00:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- New module repos (one reader for the zypp repos and services),
  write_atomic for config files, proc.refuse_root and qt.application /
  qt.find_qml (shared app start). API 3.
- write_atomic keeps mode and SELinux label, fsyncs, unique temp file.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Oct 21 23:30:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- Shared set_var for KEY=VALUE lines in config files (was private in
  the kernel module).

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Oct 21 22:30:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- New modules proc (small probes without root) and kernel (the kernel
  opt-in: packages, boot entry, kernel modules; moved from
  nazoos-welcome). Apps require nazoos-common(api) >= 2.
- Shared Qt action runner (log, busy state, app launchers) and a shared
  QML log view that follows new output; log updates are coalesced.
- Root helpers can end an action with the exit code of a nested helper
  (Passthrough) and the zypper/Flatpak commands live in helper.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Oct 21 20:30:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- New single.Instance (moved from nazoos-welcome): one window per app,
  a second start hands its page and its Wayland activation token to
  the running window, so that window comes to the front.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Oct 19 15:45:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- Secure Boot key check also finds an enrolled key on a running
  NazoOS kernel (root sees "built-in trusted keyring" there).
- New covered(): key or its CA is enrolled, no MokManager needed.
- Helper errors after "Something went wrong." start capitalised.

